# utils/
# This directory will contain stateless utility/helper functions used across the backend.
# Planned utility modules:
#   pagination.py    → helper to build paginated query results and response metadata
#   email.py         → send transactional emails (welcome, password reset, notifications)
#   validators.py    → custom field validators (e.g., phone number, student ID format)
#   date_helpers.py  → date arithmetic utilities (term dates, age calculation)
#   response.py      → standardized API response envelope builder
